OptiMobilePlus – License Agreement and Terms of Use!

1. Ownership and Source Code:
OptimobilePlus (hereinafter: "MOD") is the sole intellectual property of the creator.
The MOD is closed source.
Decrypting the source code (decompilation), modifying it, incorporating any detail into another project or rewriting the mod is strictly prohibited.

2. Distribution ban:
Uploading and distributing MOD files (.jar) to any other website, hosting, or social media is not permitted without the creator's permission.
The mod can only be downloaded through the official CurseForge and Modrinth interfaces.

3. Modpack Usage:
The mod can be freely and without prior permission request into any modpack (be it public or private), if:
the name of the creator and the original name of the mod is clearly indicated.
The modpack describes a link to the mod's official CurseForge or Modrinth page.

4. Content production:
Mod can be freely presented in videos and broadcasts (youtube, Twitch, Tiktok, etc.) provided that the official download link is indicated in the description.

5. Responsibility:
The creator is not responsible for possible performance problems or software errors resulting from the use of the mod.